  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "TS32.423: Fix dissector for alternate formats",
  "description": "The existing dissector for TS32.423 files only populates the source address of some xml capture files and does not populate the destination address, source port, or destination port due to some \"magic\" skipping ahead of curr_pos in wiretap/nettrace_3gpp_32_423.c.  \nThis commit uses regular expressions to locate and capture each field.  It has been tested against the various TS32.423 formats that have been encountered and does a complete job of populating the fields.  \nIt supports IPv4 and IPv6 addresses and removes the optional [] around IPv6 addresses if present.",
